---
const briefingPayload =
  '{"briefingRunId":"briefing:20260818014652","profileId":"morning","status":\u2026}';
---

<div class="deck-frame" aria-label="neondeck dashboard preview">
  <div class="deck-screen">
    <div class="statusline">
      <span class="brand-segment"
        ><span class="brand-dot"></span>neondeck <em>v0.4.1</em></span
      >
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span>CPU 12%</span>
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span>MEM 8.4/32G</span>
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span class="teal">GPU 41%</span>
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span class="teal">54°C</span>
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span class="violet">NET ↓1.2 ↑0.3</span>
      <span class="divider">│</span>
      <span class="online"><span></span>flue:online</span>
      <span class="clock">14:32:07</span>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-body">
      <section class="github-panel">
        <header><span>● GITHUB · @you</span><span>4 OPEN PRs</span></header>
        <div class="pr-row">
          <p><span>flue/harness</span><span>#1284 · 2h</span></p>
          <strong>fix: retry durable steps on cold start</strong>
          <small><span>● checks pass</span><span>◆ 2 review</span></small>
        </div>
        <div class="pr-row">
          <p><span>neondeck/core</span><span>#312 · 5h</span></p>
          <strong>feat: configurable statusline sensors</strong>
          <small
            ><span class="pink">● 1 failing</span><span>△ draft</span></small
          >
        </div>
        <div class="pr-row">
          <p><span>neondeck/panels</span><span>#88 · 1d</span></p>
          <strong>add github review-requests panel</strong>
          <small><span>● checks pass</span><span>↻ rebase</span></small>
        </div>
        <div class="pr-row">
          <p><span>neondeck/docs</span><span>#204 · 2d</span></p>
          <strong>docs: autopilot delivery guards</strong>
          <small><span>● checks pass</span><span>◆ 1 review</span></small>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="chat-panel">
        <header>
          <span>● FLUE AGENT · morning briefing</span><span
            >durable · ctx 18k</span
          >
        </header>
        <div class="chat-scroll">
          <div class="bubble agent briefing">
            <p class="brief-title">
              <span class="brief-dot"></span>Morning briefing · Aug 18
            </p>
            <p class="brief-label">Failing checks (needs attention)</p>
            <p class="brief-item">
              <code>neondeck/core#312</code> · 1 of 15 checks failing, last updated
              5h ago.
            </p>
            <p class="brief-label">Open PRs, checks green (3 of 4)</p>
            <p class="brief-item">
              <code>flue/harness#1284</code> has 2 reviewers waiting on you.
              <code>#88</code> and <code>#204</code> need nothing from you.
            </p>
            <p class="brief-label">Watches and Autopilot</p>
            <p class="brief-item">
              One watch on #312, prepare-only. Nothing pending approval.
            </p>
            <p class="brief-next">
              <span>Suggested next action:</span> dig into #312's failing check. Want
              me to pull the CI details?
            </p>
            <p class="brief-data">
              <span class="data-tag">DATA</span> briefing <em
                >{briefingPayload}</em
              >
              <span class="data-full">full</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="composer">
          <span>›</span><em>Message neondeck...</em><small
            >Enter send · Ctrl K tools</small
          >
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .deck-frame {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    background: #05060a;
    padding: 10px;
  }

  .deck-screen {
    aspect-ratio: 2560 / 720;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0a0b10;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }

  .statusline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 30px;
    gap: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    background: #070810;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-size: clamp(6px, 0.9vw, 12px);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .brand-segment {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    align-self: stretch;
    padding: 0 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 79, 184, 0.12);
    color: var(--pink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .brand-segment em {
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.42);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .brand-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--pink);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pink);
  }

  .divider {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .teal {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .violet {
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .online {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .online span {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--teal);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--teal);
  }

  .clock {
    margin-left: auto;
    padding-right: 14px;
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .deck-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4fr 8fr;
    height: calc(100% - 30px);
  }

  .github-panel,
  .chat-panel {
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255, 79, 184, 0.04),
      transparent 40%
    );
  }

  .chat-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-right: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(0, 183, 199, 0.04),
      transparent 36%
    );
  }

  .github-panel header,
  .chat-panel header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--pink);
    font-size: clamp(6px, 0.8vw, 11px);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .chat-panel header {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .github-panel header span:last-child,
  .chat-panel header span:last-child {
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.44);
  }

  .pr-row {
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .pr-row p,
  .pr-row small {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.48);
    font-size: clamp(6px, 0.78vw, 10.5px);
  }

  .pr-row strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 2px 0 4px;
    color: var(--body);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(8px, 1vw, 13px);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pr-row small span:first-child {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .pr-row .pink {
    color: var(--pink) !important;
  }

  .chat-scroll {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(5px, 0.9vw, 11px);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(7px, 1.2vw, 14px) clamp(9px, 1.5vw, 18px);
  }

  .bubble {
    max-width: 76%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.9);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(8px, 1vw, 13px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: clamp(5px, 0.75vw, 9px) clamp(7px, 1.1vw, 13px);
  }

  .bubble.agent {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--teal);
  }

  .bubble span {
    color: var(--pink);
  }

  .bubble.briefing {
    align-self: stretch;
    max-width: 100%;
    font-size: clamp(7px, 0.82vw, 11.5px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .briefing p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .briefing .brief-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 0.45em;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .briefing .brief-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--teal);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--teal);
  }

  .briefing .brief-label {
    margin-top: 0.5em;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .briefing .brief-item {
    padding-left: 1em;
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.68);
  }

  .briefing .brief-item code {
    color: var(--pink);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.94em;
  }

  .briefing .brief-next {
    margin-top: 0.7em;
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .briefing .brief-next span {
    color: var(--violet);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .briefing .brief-data {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 0.75em;
    padding-top: 0.5em;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.34);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.86em;
  }

  .briefing .brief-data em {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-style: normal;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .briefing .data-tag {
    color: var(--cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .briefing .data-full {
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .composer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    background: #070810;
    font-size: clamp(6px, 0.85vw, 13px);
  }

  .composer span {
    color: var(--pink);
  }

  .composer em {
    flex: 1;
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.42);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .composer small {
    color: rgba(215, 247, 255, 0.35);
  }

  /* A 32:9 strip at phone width is a 90px sliver, so stack it and let it breathe. */
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .deck-screen {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
    }

    .deck-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      height: auto;
    }

    .github-panel {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .chat-scroll {
      overflow: visible;
      padding: 12px 14px;
    }

    .statusline,
    .github-panel header,
    .chat-panel header,
    .pr-row p,
    .pr-row small,
    .composer {
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .pr-row strong,
    .bubble {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .bubble.briefing {
      font-size: 10.5px;
    }
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .github-panel {
    border-bottom-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.13);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .deck-frame {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.18);
    background: #d8eaf0;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .deck-screen {
    background: #eef7fa;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .statusline,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .composer {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.13);
    background: #d9ecf2;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .brand-segment {
    background: rgba(224, 57, 155, 0.11);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .brand-segment em,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .clock,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .github-panel header span:last-child,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .chat-panel header span:last-child,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .pr-row p,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .pr-row small,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .composer em,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .composer small {
    color: rgba(19, 23, 30, 0.58);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .divider {
    color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.18);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .github-panel,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .chat-panel {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.13);
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(224, 57, 155, 0.08),
      transparent 42%
    );
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .chat-panel {
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(0, 147, 168, 0.08),
      transparent 38%
    );
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .github-panel header,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .chat-panel header,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .pr-row,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .composer {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.11);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .pr-row strong,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .bubble {
    color: #19232e;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .bubble {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.12);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .briefing .brief-item,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .briefing .brief-next {
    color: rgba(19, 23, 30, 0.78);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .briefing .brief-data {
    border-color: rgba(18, 40, 55, 0.16);
    color: rgba(19, 23, 30, 0.5);
  }
</style>
